ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi070: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing EDGE_LOOP with 1 SURFACE_CURVE edge; 3D curve: straight LINE from (0,0,0) to (10,0,0); pcurve: B_SPLINE_CURVE_WITH_KNOTS degree 2 with endpoints (0,0) and (10,0) matching 3D endpoints in UV, but control point at (5.0,0.01) causes mid-edge pcurve arc to diverge from the 3D straight line; CheckCurveGaps detects mid-edge divergence only by sampling; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty; EDGE_CURVE IS wired into EDGE_LOOP; never orphaned */
